{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "let me show you the Dubai map, the way I see it, not as a list of areas, but as a money map.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000001"}], "text": "Location is crucial when investing in Dubai real estate. Understanding a 'money map' is more important than simply focusing on city center or waterfront properties."}, "title": "Importance of location", "topic": "investment locations"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:22b4b2bab50ee9b7", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Importance of location", "topic": "investment locations", "topic_slug": "investment-locations"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Dubai doesn't work like that.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002"}], "text": "Dubai's growth pattern is different from other world capitals, which usually expand from a historical core. Instead, Dubai creates multiple new centers with government planning."}, "title": "Growth comparison with other cities", "topic": "urban growth patterns"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:9ec59931658b1455", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Growth comparison with other cities", "topic": "urban growth patterns", "topic_slug": "urban-growth-patterns"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000007"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "One of the simplest ways to start understanding Dubai, past, current, and future demand is through its main roads.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000007"}], "text": "A mistake in Dubai real estate investment is often due to a weak strategy rather than the area itself. Understanding main roads and future metro lines can help."}, "title": "Strategy in good areas", "topic": "investment strategies"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:2ee559e8de6506e3", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Strategy in good areas", "topic": "investment strategies", "topic_slug": "investment-strategies"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000016"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "you renovate it, you rebuild it, and then you sell it with profit.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000016"}], "text": "Flip older properties for profit."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "buy an older property, you renovate it, you rebuild it, and then you sell it with profit.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000016"}], "text": "In Dubai, flipping involves buying, renovating, and selling older properties for profit. This differs from buying off-plan and reselling before completion."}, "title": "Flipping properties", "topic": "property flipping"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:ea59cac44d2b5f12", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Flipping properties", "topic": "property flipping", "topic_slug": "property-flipping"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000019"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you will have of only rental income. The price appreciation will be completely minimal.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000019"}], "text": "Investing in older buildings in Dubai Marina might not yield high price appreciation but can provide steady rental income."}, "title": "Investment in older buildings", "topic": "investment strategies"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:96a01a24c72941d6", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Investment in older buildings", "topic": "investment strategies", "topic_slug": "investment-strategies"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000004", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000006"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "the developer is new, is actually the first residential project for him, and before he was building warehouses.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000006"}], "text": "Although located in a good area on paper, the properties were affected by developer issues and delays."}, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Apple came to me for a consultation around nine months ago. They had a portfolio of three units in Dubai.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000004"}], "text": "Apple consulted about a property portfolio in Dubai that was underperforming."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Apple's consultation experience", "topic": "investment mistakes"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:cases:9fbaad8d30330173", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Apple's consultation experience", "topic": "investment mistakes", "topic_slug": "investment-mistakes"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000001"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Every developer presentation promises future demand, high ROI, limited supply, and a strong capital appreciation.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker structures the presentation by first challenging common investment advice, then reframing Dubai's city layout as a 'money map'."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Investment presentation structure", "topic": "investment locations"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:expression:7ed10cb61465abe8", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Investment presentation structure", "topic": "investment locations", "topic_slug": "investment-locations"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000003"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "The difference between the growth of any other world capital and Dubai is not obvious from the beginning.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000002"}], "text": "The speaker compares Dubai's multiple centers to New York's Brooklyn and Manhattan, then contrasts it with European cities' single central core."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Comparison of city growth patterns", "topic": "urban growth patterns"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:expression:99789ef80f118cf9", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Comparison of city growth patterns", "topic": "urban growth patterns", "topic_slug": "urban-growth-patterns"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000028"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "buying in these areas in the future going to give you definitely a stronger price appreciation.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000028"}], "text": "Buying in certain areas in the future is going to give a stronger price appreciation."}, "title": "Future Price Appreciation", "topic": "Real Estate Investment Tips"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:99187aa00fd26467", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Future Price Appreciation", "topic": "Real Estate Investment Tips", "topic_slug": "real-estate-investment-tips"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000031"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Academic city is full of universities and as well with the growth of Dubai and the education accessibility here, you literally can, uh, instead of going to US, London, you can have the same education degree here in Dubai.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000031"}], "text": "Academic City in Dubai offers growth in education accessibility, providing similar education degrees as in the US and London."}, "title": "Academic City Benefits", "topic": "Education"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:67fc9006b166d6a7", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Academic City Benefits", "topic": "Education", "topic_slug": "education"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000033"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I would say anything that has a connectivity but looks yet like a sand desert, despite logic, this is where you should buy.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000033"}], "text": "Invest in areas with connectivity even if they currently appear undeveloped (like a sand desert) for future price appreciation and rental yield, despite the logic against it."}, "title": "Investment Outlook in Dubai", "topic": "Real Estate Investment"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:9908988ec041de30", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Investment Outlook in Dubai", "topic": "Real Estate Investment", "topic_slug": "real-estate-investment"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000034"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "At that time I was already an agent here for a year. But I was thinking as a new agent, uh oh my god, it's so far. Who will even be interested in living here? It was completely deserted, nothing happening area.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000034"}], "text": "The speaker reflects on Creek Harbor's early days as a deserted and seemingly unattractive area for investment, despite its later success."}, "title": "Creek Harbor Investment Reflection", "topic": "Real Estate Trends"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:48f223e3a49c722b", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Creek Harbor Investment Reflection", "topic": "Real Estate Trends", "topic_slug": "real-estate-trends"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000046"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Do you actually read the buyer map as an investor? Before you buy, ask the six questions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "To guide real estate investment decisions."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Who is the tenant, buyer, or end user for this property?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Determine the tenant, buyer, or end user for the property."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Why would they choose this location, not somewhere else?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Analyze why they would choose this particular location over others."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "What is the demand engine for the next five to ten years? Is it business? Is it metro, airport, family lifestyle, waterfront, the future infrastructure shift?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Identify the demand engine for the next five to ten years (business, metro, airport, family lifestyle, waterfront, infrastructure shift)."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "What can push the price up, and what can slow down your exit?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Assess factors that can increase property prices and factors that can slow down your exit."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "What happens if the project gets delayed.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000046"}], "text": "Consider the possibility and implications if the project is delayed."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Before you buy, ask the six questions. Who is the tenant, buyer, or end user for this property? Why would they choose this location, not somewhere else? What is the demand engine for the next five to ten years? Is it business? Is it metro, airport, family lifestyle, waterfront, the future infrastructure shift? What can push the price up, and what can slow down your exit?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000045"}], "text": "Before investing, ask yourself six questions to guide your real estate investment decision-making."}, "title": "Questions for Investors", "topic": "Investment Strategy"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:fc75d9eec82a4062", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Questions for Investors", "topic": "Investment Strategy", "topic_slug": "investment-strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000047"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "offering", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "This is why I offer a private investment strategy sessions. We look at your situation, budget, cash flow, risk level, and exit strategy. You will walk away with a refreshing clarity.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000047"}], "text": "The speaker offers private investment strategy sessions to help investors understand their money map, areas fitting their budget and goals, and areas to avoid."}, "title": "Private Investment Strategy Sessions", "topic": "Investment Services"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:knowledge:b85966c94891cb14", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Private Investment Strategy Sessions", "topic": "Investment Services", "topic_slug": "investment-services"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000034", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000035", "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000036"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "But I was thinking as a new agent, uh oh my god, it's so far. Who will even be interested in living here? It was completely deserted, nothing happening area.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000034"}], "text": "The location was perceived as too far and deserted, raising doubts about its potential."}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": {"citations": [{"quote": "So I would say probably twenty percent of those who are living in currently in Creek, anyhow connected with the airport, Emirates.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000036"}], "text": "Creek Harbor saw significant demand and value increase, partly due to its proximity to the Dubai airport and the living needs of airport staff."}, "rationale": {"citations": [{"quote": "It was completely deserted, nothing happening area. And uh there were people who saw the the value of the new downtown um because this is exactly how Imar was positioning it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000035"}], "text": "Despite initial doubts, Creek Harbor developed a unique demand, doubling the investment for early believers because of strategic location and marketing by Imar."}, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "I remember myself at this launch. At that time I was already an agent here for a year.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:u000034"}], "text": "The speaker recalls the experience and initial perceptions during the Creek Harbor launch in 2015-2016."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Creek Harbor Launch Experience", "topic": "Real Estate Reflections"}, "content_hash": "816b26b8b0ea0cea3edcb83ed23a675f48f597bfd0a95ae2ed3bee5e4bf11a9c", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49:cases:90150e329162db26", "metadata_hash": "215bf1c7894982e9065422e3f2c32e69f87870e671ce842447ffe74097ca2fe6", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-06-24", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "7e4c500e49864bda1358a5da155c5d4ae47e364188b99edde85cb994ed77a765", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-06-24-the-dubai-areas-that-will-rise-over-the-next-10-years-k4mivs-55e5a76b49", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k4mivSZgOpA", "title": "Creek Harbor Launch Experience", "topic": "Real Estate Reflections", "topic_slug": "real-estate-reflections"}
